    {
      "id": "manager-remainder/a-warmed-seam-is-the-beat",
      "covers": [
        "queue-manager::a warmed seam is the beat; an unwarmed one is the load — measured on the virtual clock"
      ],
      "note": "A cold load costs 9,153 ms on the scenario clock (the device measurement, run 32036295743). The first segment's own load is cold; then the window warms s1, and from the out-point the next segment is silent through 499 ms and audible at 500 ms: the authored beat, still honoured.",
